msgid "TOME_CALM@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of Inner Peace"

msgid "TOME_CALM@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"“When you are drinking your tea, just drink your tea. Do not drink your "
"worries, your projects, your regrets. When you hold your cup, take a deep "
"breath and feel the aromas, the leaves and fruits contained within the "
"water. Bring your mind back to your body, stop your thinking, and become "
"fully present. Only then will you achieve true freedom and calm.\""

msgid "TOME_CALM@TOME@LORE_AUTHOR"
msgstr "Masamune Tsume, Oelian Priest"

msgid "TOME_CALM@TOME@GAMEPLAY_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Discover the natural order of all things by engaging with cultural "
"traditions and fostering a connection with both body and mind. Focus on "
"healing, stability and {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.CALM_DISARMED.Hyperlink} enemy "
"aggression."

msgid "TOME_CALM@SKILL_1@NAME"
msgstr "Tranquilizing Pressure Point"

msgid "TOME_CALM@SKILL_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target Tier I, Tier II or Tier III unit suffers: [bulletlist][bullet/]20 "
"{GLOBAL.SpiritDamageConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"CALM_DISARMED.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_CALM@SKILL_2@NAME"
msgstr "Soothing Elemental"

msgid "TOME_CALM@SKILL_2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Summon a {GLOBAL.UNITS.TEA_ELEMENTAL_UNIT.Hyperlink} to target hex."

msgid "TOME_CALM@SKILL_2@ABILITY_1@NAME"
msgstr "Clear Mind"

msgid "TOME_CALM@SKILL_2@ABILITY_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"[bulletlist][bullet/]+10 {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink}. "
"[bullet/]Dispel 1 negative status effect."

msgid "TOME_CALM@SKILL_2@ABILITY_2@NAME"
msgstr "Aromatic Glimmer"

msgid "TOME_CALM@SKILL_2@ABILITY_2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Teleport to target hex, all friendly units in a 2-hex radius gain: "
"[bulletlist][bullet/]15{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}. "
"[bullet/]This unit ends it's turn in {GLOBAL.DefenseModeConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_CALM@TEA_HOUSE@NAME"
msgstr "[researchpost/] Tea house"

msgid "TOME_CALM@TEA_HOUSE@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Gain an extra +2 {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink} and +1 {GLOBAL."
"KnowledgeConcept.Hyperlink} per tea house built in your empire. Can also be "
"built on {GLOBAL.OutpostConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_CALM@SKILL_3@NAME"
msgstr "Shinrinyoku"

msgid "TOME_CALM@SKILL_3@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target unit and all friendly units in a 1-Hex radius gain: [bulletlist]"
"[bullet/]15 {GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]15 {GLOBAL."
"TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink} if on the center of the area."

msgid "TOME_CALM@SKILL_4@NAME"
msgstr "Imperial Guards"

msgid "TOME_CALM@SKILL_4@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"A defensive {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.POLEARM_UNIT.Hyperlink} with a high damaging "
"single attack, able to use extra retaliations in {GLOBAL.DefenseModeConcept."
"Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_CALM@SKILL_5@NAME"
msgstr "Sento"

msgid "TOME_CALM@SKILL_5@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"A center of traditional healing and meditation: [bulletlist][bullet/]+15 "
"{GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink} income. Units build in this city "
"gain the {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MINDCLEANTEA.Hyperlink} ability."

msgid "TOME_RONIN@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of the Vagabond"

msgid "TOME_RONIN@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"\"The best part about treason is that even when they expect it, they can not "
"escape it. Watching them try and struggle in vain, like a fly in a spider "
"web, is such a delight.\""

msgid "TOME_RONIN@TOME@LORE_AUTHOR"
msgstr "Djack Okuni the first oelian traitor"

msgid "TOME_RONIN@TOME@GAMEPLAY_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"To follow this path of mastery one must get rid of doubts, fear and ethics. "
"Exploit what lies hidden deeply in our darker selves and learn how to use "
"real power, for a price."

msgid "TOME_RONIN@HEROES_SKILL@NAME"
msgstr "Calamity Acolyte"

msgid "TOME_RONIN@HEROES_SKILL@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Your affinity to the Calamity path grants: [bulletlist][bullet/]Summon a "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.ACCURSED.Hyperlink} version of a {GLOBAL.UNITS."
"YOUNG_DRAGON_OBSIDIAN_ACCURSED.Hyperlink} at beginning of battle."

msgid "TOME_RONIN@SKILL_1@NAME"
msgstr "Oiran Yukaku"

msgid "TOME_RONIN@SKILL_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"+10 {GLOBAL.GoldConcept.Hyperlink} income. Gain 10 {GLOBAL.GoldConcept."
"Hyperlink} and 5 {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink} for each level of "
"Evil {GLOBAL.AlignmentConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_RONIN@SKILL_2@NAME"
msgstr "[unitprod/] Ronin's Hideout"

msgid "TOME_RONIN@SKILL_2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Gain 10 {GLOBAL.UnitProductionConcept.Hyperlink} and 5 {GLOBAL."
"ImperiumConcept.Hyperlink} income in your city. Cost an extra -10 {GLOBAL."
"CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink} per Ronin's Hideout built in your empire. "
"Can also be built on {GLOBAL.OutpostConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_RONIN@SKILL_3@NAME"
msgstr "Consuming Blaze"

msgid "TOME_RONIN@SKILL_3@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target friendly Tier III+ or Hero unit unleashes a mighty blaze to all units "
"around it: [bulletlist][bullet/]Original unit sustain 25 {GLOBAL."
"FireDamageConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]All other units suffer 45 {GLOBAL."
"FireDamageConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_RONIN@SKILL_4@NAME"
msgstr "Sword Testing"

msgid "TOME_RONIN@SKILL_4@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target army lead by a Hero or Leader takes 100 {GLOBAL.HitPointConcept."
"Hyperlink} in damage, giving you in return: [bulletlist][bullet/]A low "
"amount of {GLOBAL.GoldConcept.Hyperlink} for each unit that is present in "
"your army. [bullet/]250 {GLOBAL.ExperienceConcept.Hyperlink} for every hero "
"that is present and survives in your army."

msgid "TOME_RONIN@SKILL_5@NAME"
msgstr "Kensei"

msgid "TOME_RONIN@SKILL_5@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"A aging swordmaster that has given up everything in pursuit of the way of "
"the sword."

msgid "TOME_RONIN@SKILL_5@BASE_ATTACK@NAME"
msgstr "Extinguinshing Blade"

msgid "TOME_RONIN@SKILL_5@BASE_ATTACK@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Deals double the damage against Heroes and Tier IV+ units. This unit suffers "
"30% of their dealt damage in return."

msgid "TOME_RONIN@SKILL_6@NAME"
msgstr "Accursed Lantern"

msgid "TOME_RONIN@SKILL_6@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target friendly unit unleashes a demonic seal and is possessed by what lies "
"within: [bulletlist][bullet/]Becomes a {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.ACCURSED."
"Hyperlink}. [bullet/]+50% increased damage to all Attacks. [bullet/]+3 "
"{GLOBAL.FireDamageConcept.Hyperlink} and +3 {GLOBAL.FrostDamageConcept."
"Hyperlink} to all Basic Attacks. [bullet/] Resurgence if victorious in "
"battle. [bullet/] Dies in 2 {GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_NEW@DEBUFF@1"
msgstr "Neutralized"

msgid "TOME_NEW@DEBUFF@2"
msgstr ""
"This unit's energy is temporarily sapped out of it's body. [bulletlist]"
"[bullet/]All Attacks are disabled."

msgid "TOME_NEW@DEBUFF@3"
msgstr "Demonic Posession"

msgid "TOME_NEW@DEBUFF@4"
msgstr ""
"This unit is being possessed by an accursed spirit: [bulletlist]"
"[bullet/]Becomes a {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.ACCURSED.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]+50% "
"damage to all Attacks. [bullet/]+3 {GLOBAL.FireDamageConcept.Hyperlink} and "
"+3 {GLOBAL.FrostDamageConcept.Hyperlink} to all Basic Attacks. [bullet/] "
"Resurgence if victorious in battle. [bullet/] Dies in 2 {GLOBAL.TurnConcept."
"Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_KENSEI@Skill@1"
msgstr "Tiandi Form"

msgid "TOME_KENSEI@Skill@2"
msgstr ""
"High damaging single attack, unit ends in {GLOBAL.DefenseModeConcept."
"Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_KENSEI@Skill@3"
msgstr "Sanzu's toll"

msgid "TOME_KENSEI@Skill@4"
msgstr ""
"Once this unit's reaches 35% of their original {GLOBAL.HitPointConcept."
"Hyperlink}, gain: [bulletlist][bullet/]5 {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STRENGTHENED."
"Hyperlink}. [bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STEADFAST.Hyperlink} for 2 {GLOBAL."
"TurnConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_YOKAI@Skill@1"
msgstr "Jade Discipline"

msgid "TOME_YOKAI@Skill@2"
msgstr ""
"Your will, my hands: [bulletlist][bullet/]+1 {GLOBAL.RetaliationConcept."
"Hyperlink} during {GLOBAL.DefenseModeConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_YOKAI@Skill@3"
msgstr "Inner Peace"

msgid "TOME_YOKAI@Skill@4"
msgstr ""
"This unit spent a lifetime cultivating mind and body: [bulletlist][bullet/] "
"Add the {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MINDCLEANTEA.Hyperlink} ability."

msgid "TOME_PANTHEON@Skill@1"
msgstr "Ascension: Calamity Acolyte"

msgid "TOME_PANTHEON@Skill@2"
msgstr "Path to Calamity"

msgid "TOME_PANTHEON@Skill@3"
msgstr "Accursed Path"

msgid "TOME_PANTHEON@Skill@4"
msgstr "Ascension: Accursed Acolyte"

msgid "TOME_PANTHEON@Skill@5"
msgstr "Hesitation is Defeat"

msgid "TOME_PANTHEON@Skill@6"
msgstr ""
"Lifesteals for 100% of the damage dealt, if targeting a Hero or Tier IV+ "
"unit, lifesteals for 200% instead."

msgid "TOME_PANTHEON@Skill@7"
msgstr ""
"Your affinity to the Accursed path grants: [bulletlist][bullet/]Summon an "
"{GLOBAL.UNITS.ACCURSED_OGRE.Hyperlink} at beginning of battle. [bullet/] "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.ACCURSED_BODY.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_PANTHEON@Skill@8"
msgstr "Accursed Young Dragon"

msgid "TOME_KENSEIHEALM@Skill@4"
msgstr "3"

msgid "TOME_KENSEIHEALM@Skill@5"
msgstr "4"
